Package: airgapllm
Title: Verifiably Offline Containerized Local LLM Workflows
Version: 0.5.2
Authors@R: 
    person("Marcus", "Harris", , "marcus.harris.uconn@gmail.com", role = c("aut", "cre", "cph"))
Description: Provides a privacy-first workbench for running verifiably offline,
    containerized local large language models ('Ollama', 'llama.cpp', and
    'vLLM') on sensitive research data under 'IRB', 'HIPAA', and 'FERPA'
    protocols. Generates hardened 'Docker' and 'Apptainer' container
    configurations with network isolation and pinned 'SHA-256' image and
    model-weight digests, executes deterministic pre-inference personally
    identifiable information (PII) detection, redaction, and keyed
    'HMAC-SHA256' reversible pseudonymization, performs crash-resumable
    schema-enforced batch extraction into typed tibbles with structured repair
    retries, and maintains tamper-evident hash-chained 'JSONL' audit trails
    alongside 'IRB' protocol documentation.
